(text "USB 3 Standard-B (FX3). SS TX AC-coupled with 100 nF (placement: docs/design.md). ESD on the\nreceptacle side of the caps. Shield to GND through 100k || 2.2 nF (AN70707 Figure 35). SS RX is\nwired P-to-N (FX3 SSRXP to receptacle SSRX-), which AN70707 p.22 allows, so the pair reaches the\nreceptacle without crossing." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "76843933-78d3-4196-8245-f74bbd0bcaa5"))
